# Effective indices of the full and the shallow-etched slab, and the group index of their mean.
# Reference: root of the three-layer dispersion relation found with SciPy.
title 340 nm silicon slab, oxide cladding
stack core=0.34
materials clad=sio2
grating angle=10 etch=0.109
expect n_full 3.11585188 2e-07
expect n_etched 2.88276867 2e-07
expect n_grating 2.99931028 2e-07
expect group_index 3.73813499 0.0002
